#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:1001
msgid "Do you want to enable pruning?"
msgstr "Voulez vous activer l'élagage ?"

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:1001
msgid ""
"Save storage space by pruning (deleting) old blocks  and keeping only a "
"limited copy of the blockchain."
msgstr ""
"Économisez de l'espace de stockage en élaguant (supprimant) les anciens "
"blocs et en ne conservant qu'une copie limitée de la blockchain."

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:2001
msgid "Value for pruning (must be at least 550 or 0/1) in MiB:"
msgstr "Valeur d'élagage (doit être au moins de 550 ou 0/1) en Mio :"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:2001
msgid ""
"0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC,  >=550 = automatically prune "
"block files to stay under the target size in MiB"
msgstr ""
"0 = désactivé, 1 = autoriser l'élagage manuel via RPC, >=550 = élagage "
"automatique des fichiers de blocs pour rester sous la taille cible en Mio"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:3001
msgid "Couldn't configure prune"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer l'élagage"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:3001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the prune setting as expected,  please set your value "
"manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de configurer le paramètre d'élagage comme prévu.  Veuillez "
"définir manuellement la valeur dans /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:4001
msgid "Bad value for prune"
msgstr "Mauvaise valeur pour l'élagage"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:4001
msgid "Prune must be 0, 1 or superior or equal to 550"
msgstr "l'élagage doit être 0, 1 ou supérieur ou égale à 550"

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:5001
msgid "Do you want to enable transaction index?"
msgstr "Souhaitez-vous activer l'index des transactions ?"

#. Type: boolean
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:5001
msgid "This is required for electrum servers and various other software"
msgstr "Ceci est nécessaire pour les serveurs Electrum et d'autres logiciels"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:6001
msgid "Couldn't configure txindex"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer txindex"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:6001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the txindex setting as expected,  please set your value "
"manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de configurer le paramètre txindex comme prévu.  Veuillez définir "
"manuellement la valeur dans /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:7001
msgid "Value for dbcache (must be at least 4) in MiB:"
msgstr "Valeur de dbcache (doit être au moins de 4) en Mio :"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:7001
msgid ""
"A larger cache can speed up the initial synchronization of your Bitcoin "
"node,   but after the initial sync is complete, a larger cache value does "
"not  significantly improve performance and may use more RAM than needed."
msgstr ""
"Un cache plus important peut accélérer la synchronisation initiale de votre "
"nœud Bitcoin, mais une fois la synchronisation initiale terminée, une valeur "
"de cache plus importante n'améliore pas significativement les performances "
"et peut utiliser plus de RAM que nécessaire."

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:8001
msgid "Couldn't configure dbcache"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer dbcache"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:8001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the dbcache setting as expected,  please set your value "
"manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de configurer le paramètre dbcache comme prévu.  Veuillez définir "
"manuellement la valeur dans /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:9001
msgid "Bad value for dbcache"
msgstr "Mauvaise valeur pour dbcache"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:9001
msgid "dbcache must be superior or equal to 4"
msgstr "dbcache doit être supérieur ou égale à 4"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:10001
msgid "bitcoin.conf file missing, unable to interactively configure bitcoind"
msgstr ""
"Fichier bitcoin.conf manquant, impossible de configurer bitcoind de manière "
"interactive"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:10001
msgid ""
"the file /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf is missing, debconf expect this file to  "
"interactively configure bitcoind."
msgstr ""
"Le fichier /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf est manquant, debconf attend ce fichier "
"pour configurer bitcoind de manière interactive."

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:11001
msgid "Value for pruneduringinit (must be at least 550 or -1/0/1) in MiB:"
msgstr ""
"Valeur de pruneduringinit (doit être au moins de 550 ou -1/0/1) en Mio :"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:11001
msgid ""
"-1 = same as prune, 0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC,  >=550 = "
"automatically prune block files to stay under the target size in MiB"
msgstr ""
"-1 = même que prune, 0 = désactivé, 1 = autoriser l'élagage manuel via RPC, "
">=550 = élagage automatique des fichiers de blocs pour rester sous la taille "
"cible en Mio"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:12001
msgid "Bad value for pruneduringinit"
msgstr "Mauvaise valeur pour pruneduringinit"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:12001
msgid "Pruneduringinit must be -1, 0, 1 or superior or equal to 550"
msgstr "Pruneduringinit doit être -1, 0, 1 ou supérieur ou égale à 550"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:13001
msgid "Couldn't configure pruneduringinit"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer pruneduringinit"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:13001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the pruneduringinit setting as expected,  please set your "
"value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de configurer le paramètre pruneduringinit comme prévu.  Veuillez "
"définir manuellement la valeur dans /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:14001
msgid "Value for rpcthreads (must be superior or equal to 0):"
msgstr "la valeur de rpcthreads doit être supérieur ou égale à 0"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:14001
msgid "Set the number of threads to service RPC calls"
msgstr "Définit le nombre de threads pour les appels RPC"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:15001
msgid "Bad value for rpcthreads"
msgstr "Mauvaise valeur pour rpcthreads"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:15001
msgid "rpcthreads must be superior or equal to 0"
msgstr "rpcthreads doit être supérieur ou égale à 0"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:16001
msgid "Couldn't configure rpcthreads"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer rpcthreads"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:16001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the rpcthreads setting as expected,  please set your "
"value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
"Impossible de configurer le paramètre rpcthreads comme prévu.  Veuillez "
"définir manuellement la valeur dans /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:17001
msgid "Value for rpcworkqueue (must be superior or equal to 0):"
msgstr "La valeur de rpcworkqueue doit être supérieur ou égale à 0"

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:17001
msgid "Set the maximum depth of the work queue to service RPC calls"
msgstr ""
"Définit la profondeur maximale de la file d'attente de travail pour traiter "
"les appels RPC"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:18001
msgid "Bad value for rpcworkqueue"
msgstr "Mauvaise valeur pour rpcworkqueue"

#. Type: note
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:18001
msgid "rpcworkqueue must be superior or equal to 0"
msgstr "rpcworkqueue doit être supérieur ou égale à 0"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:19001
msgid "Couldn't configure rpcworkqueue"
msgstr "Impossible de configurer rpcworkqueue"

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../bitcoin-knots.templates:19001
msgid ""
"Couldn't configure the rpcworkqueue setting as expected,  please set your "
"value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf"
msgstr ""
